ock":"b-0480c5aebff66afe1ffb","layer":"original","quote":"遣监军虞汜、威南将军薛珝、苍梧太守陶璜由荆州〖1〗；监军李勖、督军徐存从建安海道〖2〗：皆就合浦，击交阯","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":395,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":21,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-c88c3e9118bd688f1e90","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-8218bfa6bf0ccc90e22e","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，汜、璜破交阯，擒杀晋所置守将，九真、日南皆还属","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-341827cec2f744f90610","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-ebdb94c9270d31300148","layer":"original","quote":"贺邵字兴伯，会稽山阴人也〖1〗。﹝一﹞孙休即位，从中郎为散骑中常侍〖2〗。出为吴郡太守。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":65,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wanglou-q-c23c889454159c94bf24","section":"chapter-065","block":"b-509f07a12985aedad2c9","layer":"original","quote":"孙休即位，与贺邵、薛莹、虞汜俱为散骑中常侍〖4〗；皆加驸马都尉〖5〗，时论清之〖6〗。遣使至蜀，蜀人称焉。还，为夏口监军〖7〗。","section_title":"王楼贺韦华传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0137.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0afdb7821a1aca8855a0","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-d802ad7948c75961a8e4","layer":"original","quote":"永安初，从选曹郎为散骑中常侍","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-0b2bf6ee0a962838ea71","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-97d739059bba97722b70","layer":"pei","quote":"休未至，綝欲入宫，图为不轨；召百官会议，皆惶怖失色，徒唯唯而已。汜对曰：‘明公为国伊、周，处将相之位，擅废立之威；将上安宗庙，下惠百姓，大小踊跃，自以伊、霍复见。今迎王未至，而欲入宫；如是，群下摇荡，众听疑惑：非所以永终忠孝，扬名后世也。’綝不怿，竟立休","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2bf6738d5adf6a51cccd","start":46,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-516a6deca6b34859bb81","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-97d739059bba97722b70","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《会稽典录》曰：“汜，字世洪。生南海，年十六，父卒，还乡里。孙綝废幼主，迎立琅邪王休。休未至，綝欲入宫，图为不轨；召百官会议，皆惶怖失色，徒唯唯而已。汜对曰：‘明公为国伊、周，处将相之位，擅废立之威；将上安宗庙，下惠百姓，大小踊跃，自以伊、霍复见。今迎王未至，而欲入宫；如是，群下摇荡，众听疑惑：非所以永终忠孝，扬名后世也。’綝不怿，竟立休。休初即位，汜与贺邵、王蕃、薛莹俱为散骑中常侍。以讨扶严功，拜交州刺史，冠军将军，余姚侯。寻卒。”","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2bf6738d5adf6a51cccd","start":0,"end":222,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-57f757984493adb40016","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-97d739059bba97722b70","layer":"pei","quote":"休初即位，汜与贺邵、王蕃、薛莹俱为散骑中常侍","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2bf6738d5adf6a51cccd","start":174,"end":196,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-60f20834ae98b66279ca","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-d802ad7948c75961a8e4","layer":"original","quote":"翻有十一子。第四子汜最知名，永安初，从选曹郎为散骑中常侍〖1〗。后为监军使者〖2〗，讨扶严，病卒。﹝一﹞","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-6afee9cc8489a2eca945","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-97d739059bba97722b70","layer":"pei","quote":"以讨扶严功，拜交州刺史，冠军将军，余姚侯。寻卒","attribution":"裴注·《会稽典录》","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2bf6738d5adf6a51cccd","start":197,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-9806464979771f7fb936","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-d802ad7948c75961a8e4","layer":"original","quote":"后为监军使者〖2〗，讨扶严，病卒","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yululu-q-ff2759f7c27bc73c4324","section":"chapter-057","block":"b-97d739059bba97722b70","layer":"pei","quote":"汜，字世洪。生南海，年十六，父卒，还乡里。","attribution":"裴注·会稽典录","section_title":"虞陆张骆陆吾朱传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0121.xhtml","index":119,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2bf6738d5adf6a51cccd","start":12,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangyan-q-3a72e0f14bf9e45791ea","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-606cc23ede6891780b6d","layer":"original","quote":"孙休即位，为散骑中常侍","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":282,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":44,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
